+flf2a$ 7 7 20 1 19
+os2.flf (FIGlet font)
+
+
+By Kent Nassen, knassen@umich.edu, 4/30/95.
+
+Looks like some sigs are still good for a few figlet font ideas.
+This one's rather simplistic, I guess, but interesting nonetheless.
+Thought I'd make a figlet font out of it.  Along the "lines" of bright,
+relief, and contrast...
+--Kent
